msgid "Immich"
msgstr "Immich"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "設定"

msgid "Updated Immich settings."
msgstr "Immich 設定已更新。"

msgid "Running"
msgstr "執行中"

msgid "Stopped"
msgstr "已停止"

msgid "Partial"
msgstr "部分執行"

msgid "Not installed"
msgstr "未安裝"

msgid "Immich is a self-hosted photo and video backup solution. The stack is created in the Compose plugin (Services -> Compose -> Files) where it can also be inspected or edited; configure the Compose plugin shared folder first. Save the settings, click Apply, then use the buttons below to deploy and manage the stack. While the stack is running it starts automatically at boot."
msgstr "Immich 是自架照片/影片備份方案。堆疊會建立在 Compose 外掛中（服務 → Compose → 檔案），也可在那裡檢視或編輯；請先設定 Compose 外掛的共享資料夾。儲存設定並點「套用」後，用下方按鈕部署與管理堆疊。堆疊執行期間開機自動啟動。"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "狀態"

msgid "Service status"
msgstr "服務狀態"

msgid "Running version"
msgstr "執行版本"

msgid "Latest version"
msgstr "最新版本"

msgid "Update available"
msgstr "有可用更新"

msgid "Stack file (Compose plugin)"
msgstr "堆疊檔案（Compose 外掛）"

msgid "Stack file location. The stack files are rendered by the Compose plugin into its shared folder and are managed there, so this path cannot be changed here. Set the folder in Services -> Compose -> Settings."
msgstr "堆疊檔案位置。堆疊檔案由 Compose 外掛渲染至其共享資料夾下並於該處管理，因此此路徑無法在此變更。請在 服務 -> Compose -> 設定 中設定該資料夾。"

msgid "Service"
msgstr "服務"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "啟用"

msgid "Automatically manage the stack from OMV. On Apply the stack is (re)created; disabling the service removes the containers on Apply (photos and database are kept)."
msgstr "由 OMV 自動管理堆疊：點「套用」時建立/重建堆疊。停用服務會在「套用」時移除容器（照片與資料庫保留）。"

msgid "Version"
msgstr "版本"

msgid "Immich version tag"
msgstr "Immich 版本標籤"

msgid "Docker image tag for immich-server and the machine-learning service (e.g. release or v3.2.4). 'release' follows the latest stable release. Prefer pinning a specific version; upgrade with the Upgrade button or change the tag here and Apply."
msgstr "immich-server 與機器學習服務的 Docker 映像標籤（如 release 或 v3.2.4）。'release' 跟隨最新穩定版。建議固定具體版本；升級請用「升級」按鈕，或改標籤後點「套用」。"

msgid "Enable machine learning"
msgstr "啟用機器學習"

msgid "Adds the immich-machine-learning container for face recognition, smart search and OCR. Requires 4 GB+ of RAM in addition to the base stack."
msgstr "新增 immich-machine-learning 容器，提供人臉辨識、智慧搜尋與 OCR。在基礎堆疊之外需要 4 GB 以上記憶體。"

msgid "Storage"
msgstr "儲存"

msgid "Photo library shared folder"
msgstr "照片庫共享資料夾"

msgid "Shared folder where photos and videos are stored (container path /data). To move the photo library or the database folder, select the new folder in the form but do NOT save yet - click 'Test directories' to validate the changed folders and 'Migrate data' to copy them. Save only after the migration succeeded; the data in the old folders is removed when the settings are saved."
msgstr "存放照片與影片的共享資料夾（容器內路徑 /data）。要搬移照片庫或資料庫目錄：在表單中選取新資料夾但不要儲存——按「測試目錄」驗證已改動的資料夾，再按「遷移資料」搬移。確認遷移成功後才按儲存；儲存設定時會刪除舊資料夾裡的資料。"

msgid "Test directories"
msgstr "測試目錄"

msgid "Migrate data"
msgstr "遷移資料"

msgid "Validate the selected shared folders"
msgstr "驗證所選的共享資料夾"

msgid "Directory migration"
msgstr "目錄遷移"

msgid "Do you really want to migrate the data of the changed folders? The service is stopped, the data is copied with rsync (the originals stay untouched) and the stack is started temporarily on the new locations so that you can verify it. Nothing is saved until you click Save; the data in the old folders is removed when the settings are saved."
msgstr "確定要遷移已改動資料夾的資料嗎？服務會先停止，資料以 rsync 複製（原始資料保留），接著臨時以新位置啟動服務供你驗證。按下「儲存」之前不會寫入任何設定；儲存設定時會刪除舊資料夾裡的資料。"

msgid "Removing the previous data"
msgstr "正在刪除原資料"

msgid "Database shared folder"
msgstr "資料庫共享資料夾"

msgid "Shared folder for the PostgreSQL data. Must be on a local filesystem (NFS/SMB/CIFS shares are not supported by Immich)."
msgstr "PostgreSQL 資料的儲存位置。必須位於本機檔案系統（Immich 不支援 NFS/SMB/CIFS 網路共用）。"

msgid "Database"
msgstr "資料庫"

msgid "Database password"
msgstr "資料庫密碼"

msgid "Postgres password, generated automatically on plugin installation. Changing it after the first deployment requires resetting the database directory."
msgstr "Postgres 密碼，安裝外掛時自動產生。首次部署後修改密碼需重置資料庫目錄。"

msgid "Database username"
msgstr "資料庫使用者名稱"

msgid "Database name"
msgstr "資料庫名稱"

msgid "Network"
msgstr "網路"

msgid "Web port"
msgstr "Web 連接埠"

msgid "Port of the Immich web interface (container port is fixed at 2283)."
msgstr "Immich 網頁介面連接埠（容器內連接埠固定為 2283）。"

msgid "Timezone"
msgstr "時區"

msgid "Timezone used inside the containers, e.g. Asia/Shanghai."
msgstr "容器內使用的時區，如 Asia/Shanghai。"

msgid "Start"
msgstr "啟動"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

msgid "Restart"
msgstr "重新啟動"

msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "升級"

msgid "View logs"
msgstr "檢視日誌"

msgid "View compose file"
msgstr "檢視 Compose 檔案"

msgid "Open Immich"
msgstr "開啟 Immich"

msgid "Do you really want to stop the Immich stack? The containers are removed; photos, database and settings are kept."
msgstr "確定要停止 Immich 堆疊嗎？容器將被移除；照片、資料庫與設定保留。"

msgid "Do you really want to restart the Immich stack?"
msgstr "確定要重新啟動 Immich 堆疊嗎？"

msgid "Do you really want to upgrade the Immich stack? Newer images are pulled and the stack is recreated. Read the upstream release notes before major upgrades."
msgstr "確定要升級 Immich 堆疊嗎？將拉取新映像並重建堆疊。大版本升級前請先閱讀上游發布說明。"

msgid "Immich deploy/start output"
msgstr "Immich 部署/啟動輸出"

msgid "Immich stop output"
msgstr "Immich 停止輸出"

msgid "Immich restart output"
msgstr "Immich 重新啟動輸出"

msgid "Immich upgrade output"
msgstr "Immich 升級輸出"

msgid "Immich logs"
msgstr "Immich 日誌"

msgid "Rendered docker-compose.yml"
msgstr "渲染出的 docker-compose.yml"
